###### Art. 475.- Shall incur the penalty of a fine* of two to three pesos inclusive

1.- Those who violate the ordinances and regulations relating to fruit harvests.
2.- (Modified by Law 620 of May 23, 1944 G.O. 6090). The owners or managers of hotels or inns, or boarding houses, who fail to register, in the records that must be kept for such purpose, the names of persons who sleep or spend a day or a night in their establishments; as well as their age, marital status, color, profession or occupation, nationality and habitual domicile, as well as the place of origin, date of entry, place of destination and date of departure, with notation of the number and series of the Personal Identity Card and the number of the Internal Revenue stamp corresponding to the tax of the last year; or who

