###### Art. 479.- A fine** of four to five pesos inclusive shall be imposed

1.- On those who, outside the cases provided for by articles 434 to 462 inclusive, voluntarily cause damage to the property and movable goods of others;
2.- On those who, as a result of the wandering of madmen or lunatics, or of harmful or ferocious animals, cause the death or injury of livestock or other animals;

